  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#36f\"><strong>此模組已合併至 Amendments</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amendments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/951/632/638441223877296738.gif\" alt=\"Amendments\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#396\"><strong>更好的荷葉</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;message=Twitter&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Youtube&amp;message=Twitter&amp;logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於 📖</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這是一個非常簡單的模組，讓荷葉變得更聰明，允許在其上放置任何方塊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它是如何運作的？非常簡單，每次你點擊荷葉並手持可放置的物品時，荷葉會移動到下方的水方塊，變成一個含水方塊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果上方的方塊被移除，它將恢復為原版狀態。請注意，這只有在它下方的方塊是水方塊時才會發生。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">就是這樣，享受這個小模組吧 :D</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">製作模組佔用了我很多時間，所以如果你喜歡我的作品，並想支持我，可以在這裡進行。如果你支持我，你將獲得一個專屬的<strong>地球儀</strong>和/或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果你使用「supplementaries」代碼從 Akliz 購買伺服器，同樣適用此優惠。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？看看 Akliz，他們有專為模組化 Minecraft 設計的頂級品牌伺服器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們擁有一個溫馨的社群，提供出色的支援，伺服器運作得非常棒。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用代碼「supplementaries」可獲得<strong> 20% 折扣</strong>，同時也支持我！</span></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組 🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>",
